OpenNPU is licensed by kind of file. Full texts are in LICENSES/.

  Hardware design: Verilog RTL, constraints (.xdc), PCB and schematics
    CERN-OHL-S-2.0  (CERN Open Hardware Licence v2, Strongly Reciprocal)
    LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt

  Software: tools, models, scripts, firmware (.py .c .h .cpp .sh .tcl)
    MIT
    LICENSES/MIT.txt

  Documentation and images (.md .pdf .png .svg)
    CC-BY-4.0  (Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International)
    LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt

Every source file carries an SPDX header naming its license; when a
header and this summary disagree, the header wins.

Copyright (c) 2026 Michele (manvalan)

Commercial licensing: to use the hardware design in a product without
releasing your own design under CERN-OHL-S-2.0, a separate commercial
license is available. See COMMERCIAL_LICENSE.md.

Third-party material is listed in NOTICE and keeps its own license.
